# Render the README demo with https://github.com/charmbracelet/vhs :  vhs demo.tape
Output demo.gif
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1100
Set Height 520
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 60ms

Type "ca list" Enter Sleep 2s
Type "ca work" Enter Sleep 2s
Type "claude" Enter Sleep 4s
Ctrl+C Sleep 500ms
Ctrl+C Sleep 1s
Type "ca personal" Enter Sleep 2s
